1
00:00:46,860 --> 00:00:52,500
=The Outlaw=

2
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:54,020
(This story is entirely fictional.)

3
00:00:54,020 --> 00:00:55,900
(All settings are imaginary.)

4
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:58,900
=Episode 21=

5
00:00:59,320 --> 00:00:59,840
Run!

6
00:01:04,760 --> 00:01:05,600
After them!

7
00:01:05,600 --> 00:01:06,360
Find that key!

8
00:01:06,360 --> 00:01:07,200
After them!

9
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:07,760
Find that key!

10
00:01:08,610 --> 00:01:09,450
Key?

11
00:01:09,880 --> 00:01:10,480
The key!

12
00:01:11,200 --> 00:01:11,840
Oh no!

13
00:01:11,840 --> 00:01:12,400
Mona!

14
00:01:43,640 --> 00:01:44,000
Mona!

15
00:01:49,320 --> 00:01:50,320
Do you know who they are?

16
00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:52,320
Mercenaries.

17
00:01:53,040 --> 00:01:54,040
They'll do anything for money.

18
00:01:55,880 --> 00:01:56,440
Where's everyone else?

19
00:02:00,160 --> 00:02:01,000
Go! Move!

20
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:01,520
Everyone, move!

21
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:03,040
Go!

22
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:03,520
Move it!

23
00:02:04,320 --> 00:02:05,280
Go!

24
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:05,840
Keep them moving!

25
00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:06,760
Move!

26
00:02:07,640 --> 00:02:08,800
Quit dragging your feet! Move!

27
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:09,480
Hurry up!

28
00:02:10,280 --> 00:02:10,720
Move!

29
00:02:10,720 --> 00:02:11,640
Keep moving!

30
00:02:12,680 --> 00:02:13,080
Move!

31
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:13,800
Go!

32
00:02:14,040 --> 00:02:14,960
Go! Move!

33
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:16,640
Quit dragging your feet!

34
00:02:17,080 --> 00:02:17,480
Move!

35
00:02:17,480 --> 00:02:17,880
Hurry!

36
00:02:18,440 --> 00:02:20,760
Kneel!

37
00:02:35,880 --> 00:02:36,960
Where is Zhou Yan?

38
00:02:42,760 --> 00:02:43,280
I don't know.

39
00:02:59,000 --> 00:02:59,600
Wu!

40
00:03:03,440 --> 00:03:03,960
Wu!

41
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:05,680
It's Mom!

42
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:07,760
Wu!

43
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:09,640
It's me!

44
00:03:10,080 --> 00:03:10,720
It's Mom!

45
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:11,680
Wu!

46
00:03:12,480 --> 00:03:13,120
It's Mom!

47
00:03:13,120 --> 00:03:13,840
I've been looking for you for so long.

48
00:03:44,680 --> 00:03:46,080
Fen's been looking for him for years.

49
00:03:47,920 --> 00:03:49,040
It's his mother.

50
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:50,800
How could he pull the trigger?

51
00:03:54,040 --> 00:03:54,840
Kill them all!

52
00:04:24,200 --> 00:04:25,400
We have to stay alive

53
00:04:26,320 --> 00:04:27,520
so their deaths won't be in vain.

54
00:04:29,640 --> 00:04:30,040
Go!

55
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:35,400
They are here!

56
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:36,320
Let's go!

57
00:04:59,120 --> 00:04:59,600
Mona!

58
00:05:01,320 --> 00:05:01,800
Mona!

59
00:05:13,920 --> 00:05:14,240
Get in!

60
00:05:17,640 --> 00:05:18,160
That way.

61
00:05:18,320 --> 00:05:19,360
That area's controlled
by government forces.

62
00:05:22,760 --> 00:05:24,040
Round them up!

63
00:06:52,140 --> 00:06:58,200
♪You said side by side,
we'd make it through anything♪

64
00:06:59,580 --> 00:07:05,100
♪You said we'd walk side by side,
and cross every river in our way♪

65
00:07:06,710 --> 00:07:11,960
♪We swore to make our mark into legend♪

66
00:07:13,890 --> 00:07:19,260
♪Why'd you leave me halfway?♪

67
00:07:21,320 --> 00:07:25,020
♪We ran wild, we lived loud,
with fire in our veins♪

68
00:07:25,020 --> 00:07:28,950
♪Through tears and scars,
you stayed right by my side♪

69
00:07:28,950 --> 00:07:31,740
♪Here's a toast to the past,
to the brotherhood we shared♪

70
00:07:31,960 --> 00:07:32,680
I thought

71
00:07:33,880 --> 00:07:35,000
it was all over.

72
00:07:37,600 --> 00:07:38,840
But what did they do wrong?

73
00:07:41,280 --> 00:07:43,120
They were just ordinary people.

74
00:07:45,440 --> 00:07:48,520
Why leave them no way to survive?

75
00:07:51,560 --> 00:07:52,360
It's all my fault.

76
00:07:59,920 --> 00:08:00,600
In Langia,

77
00:08:01,920 --> 00:08:04,240
there are many ordinary people
just like them.

78
00:08:05,480 --> 00:08:07,760
This darkness won't end so easily.

79
00:08:11,490 --> 00:08:16,220
♪I said we'd walk hand in hand,
and conquer every slope life throws♪

80
00:08:18,290 --> 00:08:21,360
♪All those promises,
we never got the chance to keep♪

81
00:08:21,440 --> 00:08:21,920
Zhou Yan.

82
00:08:23,640 --> 00:08:25,240
I know this is selfish of me.

83
00:08:26,400 --> 00:08:28,800
You can leave all this and go home.

84
00:08:31,040 --> 00:08:32,000
But the darkness in Langia

85
00:08:32,480 --> 00:08:35,280
didn't end with Natuo and the other two.

86
00:08:36,720 --> 00:08:38,640
Even if it's just for the brothers

87
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:41,840
we lost, will you stay and help me?

88
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:44,240
It's not just me who needs you.

89
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:46,080
Langia needs you even more.

90
00:08:52,040 --> 00:08:52,640
You're right.

91
00:08:53,240 --> 00:09:00,160
♪This road of life, I'll walk for you♪

92
00:09:00,460 --> 00:09:03,960
♪Every light we ever saw,
I'll keep it in my heart for you♪

93
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:05,480
Things in Langia aren't settled yet.

94
00:09:08,920 --> 00:09:10,600
It's time to finish this
once and for all.

95
00:09:34,760 --> 00:09:35,720
(The pendant from my mom...)

96
00:09:35,720 --> 00:09:37,840
(Why does it have the last six digits
of the BlackGold account number?)

97
00:09:37,840 --> 00:09:40,360
(Could Mom's death be tied
to the BlackGold Key?)

98
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:43,720
About last night...

99
00:09:44,240 --> 00:09:45,480
Any idea who was behind it?

100
00:09:47,840 --> 00:09:48,840
There's no other possibility.

101
00:09:55,640 --> 00:09:56,800
Regarding last night's shootout

102
00:09:57,160 --> 00:09:59,040
at the mine outside the city,

103
00:09:59,400 --> 00:10:00,800
we now issue an official statement.

104
00:10:01,800 --> 00:10:02,240
Our investigation found

105
00:10:02,680 --> 00:10:03,320
that the incident was caused by

106
00:10:03,760 --> 00:10:05,160
infighting within a criminal group

107
00:10:05,640 --> 00:10:06,520
led by the fugitive Mian,

108
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:08,280
whose real name

109
00:10:08,600 --> 00:10:09,760
is Zhou Yan.

110
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:11,160
It resulted in

111
00:10:11,160 --> 00:10:12,080
heavy casualties

112
00:10:13,040 --> 00:10:15,080
and caused severe social repercussions.

113
00:10:16,120 --> 00:10:16,720
The group has long engaged

114
00:10:16,960 --> 00:10:18,800
in illegal trade,

115
00:10:18,800 --> 00:10:19,480
used violence to control markets,

116
00:10:19,960 --> 00:10:20,960
and committed other crimes,

117
00:10:21,760 --> 00:10:23,120
posing a serious threat

118
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:24,240
to public safety in Langia.

119
00:10:25,400 --> 00:10:25,880
We hereby

120
00:10:26,200 --> 00:10:27,240
announce

121
00:10:28,040 --> 00:10:29,840
a full-scale crackdown

122
00:10:30,240 --> 00:10:31,040
on Mian's

123
00:10:31,040 --> 00:10:31,960
criminal organization.

124
00:10:33,120 --> 00:10:36,000
Police will take firm action
to eliminate this threat to society

125
00:10:36,280 --> 00:10:37,040
and uphold the law...

126
00:10:39,120 --> 00:10:39,560
Ma Ding.

127
00:10:43,520 --> 00:10:44,320
Our brothers are dead.

128
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:47,280
But this can't end here.

129
00:10:48,320 --> 00:10:48,920
I still need you.

130
00:10:53,520 --> 00:10:55,240
I'm leaving Langia
with Daya's memorial tablet.

131
00:10:57,160 --> 00:10:58,280
I want no part of this anymore.

132
00:10:59,840 --> 00:11:00,240
Go.

133
00:11:00,840 --> 00:11:01,200
Ma Ding.

134
00:11:01,760 --> 00:11:02,240
Go!

135
00:11:07,400 --> 00:11:08,720
What happened to Daya was my fault.

136
00:11:12,040 --> 00:11:12,400
Take care.

137
00:11:25,560 --> 00:11:25,960
Ren.

138
00:11:26,800 --> 00:11:27,840
I want to see Mian.

139
00:11:28,640 --> 00:11:29,720
Please set up a meeting.

140
00:12:05,680 --> 00:12:06,200
Zhou Yan.

141
00:12:06,680 --> 00:12:07,960
You've got some guts,

142
00:12:08,840 --> 00:12:09,840
coming to see me.

143
00:12:11,120 --> 00:12:13,680
You've taken down Langia's Big Three.

144
00:12:14,480 --> 00:12:16,120
Your job is done.

145
00:12:17,880 --> 00:12:19,360
I don't need you anymore.

146
00:12:29,520 --> 00:12:30,880
You sent men to the mine to kill me

147
00:12:30,880 --> 00:12:31,680
because of the key, didn't you?

148
00:12:47,840 --> 00:12:49,080
Dashan, Suowen, and Natuo

149
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:51,600
handed over 30% of their income
every month.

150
00:12:52,520 --> 00:12:53,840
After Grand Royal laundered it,

151
00:12:54,400 --> 00:12:56,480
the money was wired
to an anonymous account at a Swiss bank.

152
00:12:57,440 --> 00:12:58,640
That account is yours, right?

153
00:12:59,840 --> 00:13:00,880
I just don't know why

154
00:13:02,840 --> 00:13:03,240
the key

155
00:13:03,720 --> 00:13:04,840
was stored at Grand Royal.

156
00:13:06,320 --> 00:13:07,640
If you want that money back,

157
00:13:08,160 --> 00:13:09,200
you need the key.

158
00:13:10,280 --> 00:13:10,920
Am I right?

159
00:13:12,640 --> 00:13:13,840
Where's the key?

160
00:13:14,240 --> 00:13:15,440
Give me back my identity as Mian.

161
00:13:16,400 --> 00:13:17,320
I still have something to do.

162
00:13:22,960 --> 00:13:24,280
I knew I picked the right man.

163
00:13:25,440 --> 00:13:27,480
You really are an outlaw.

164
00:13:29,600 --> 00:13:29,920
Fine.

165
00:13:30,680 --> 00:13:33,040
I'll give you back
your identity as Mian.

166
00:13:33,440 --> 00:13:34,080
But

167
00:13:34,720 --> 00:13:36,960
you have to truly become one of my own.

168
00:13:37,560 --> 00:13:38,480
What do you want me to do?

169
00:13:40,160 --> 00:13:41,880
Marry my adopted daughter.

170
00:13:57,210 --> 00:13:58,600
♪Dust rises along the border♪

171
00:13:58,600 --> 00:13:59,850
♪Out here, life and death are routine♪

172
00:13:59,850 --> 00:14:01,210
♪Spent shells fall, last echoes ring♪

173
00:14:01,210 --> 00:14:02,670
♪Brothers yesterday, foes today♪

174
00:14:02,670 --> 00:14:03,880
♪Fate's blade falls, who can stop it?♪

175
00:14:03,880 --> 00:14:05,260
♪Against the tide, I never bow♪

176
00:14:05,260 --> 00:14:06,550
♪The night is long, the road unclear♪

177
00:14:06,550 --> 00:14:07,960
♪My life is mine to bear♪

178
00:14:07,960 --> 00:14:10,770
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

179
00:14:10,770 --> 00:14:13,450
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

180
00:14:13,450 --> 00:14:15,940
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

181
00:14:15,940 --> 00:14:17,200
♪My fate is mine to command♪

182
00:14:17,200 --> 00:14:18,520
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪

183
00:14:18,520 --> 00:14:19,900
♪I weave through storms of bullets♪

184
00:14:19,900 --> 00:14:21,230
♪I fight through flashing blades♪

185
00:14:21,230 --> 00:14:22,630
♪Blood stains the whole land red♪

186
00:14:22,630 --> 00:14:23,980
♪The bonds we forged stay in my heart♪

187
00:14:23,980 --> 00:14:25,230
♪Plots and schemes are everywhere♪

188
00:14:25,230 --> 00:14:26,410
♪Deceit runs deep, hard to see through♪

189
00:14:26,410 --> 00:14:27,800
♪Every step is planned. I won't retreat♪

190
00:14:27,800 --> 00:14:29,260
♪A spark ignites in the dark♪

191
00:14:29,260 --> 00:14:30,670
♪So what if fate mocks me?♪

192
00:14:30,670 --> 00:14:31,900
♪This fight will defy fate itself♪

193
00:14:31,900 --> 00:14:33,250
♪Break every shackle, break every lock♪

194
00:14:33,250 --> 00:14:35,890
♪Anger burns inside my chest♪

195
00:14:35,890 --> 00:14:38,620
♪No more fear, no more losing my way♪

196
00:14:38,620 --> 00:14:41,590
♪With blood and sweat, I forge my glory♪

197
00:14:41,590 --> 00:14:44,110
♪In this world of chaos,
I carve out a road to brighter days♪

198
00:14:44,110 --> 00:14:47,240
♪My legend,
I'll write every chapter myself♪

199
00:14:51,240 --> 00:14:53,800
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

200
00:14:53,800 --> 00:14:56,520
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

201
00:14:56,520 --> 00:14:58,780
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

202
00:14:58,780 --> 00:15:01,840
♪My fate is mine to command,
who dares stand in my way?♪
